---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "去中国该带什么——季节与气候指南";
const description = "根据季节和城市准备行李——从北京冬天到广州夏天的完整清单。";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/life/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>重返生活</a>
    </nav>
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🎒 中国生活</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">为中国打包什么<br class="hidden md:block" />：季节和气候指南</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">中国的包装是不同的——这是你真正需要的。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读6分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50 to-emerald-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-4">🎯 快速回答</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-green-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>中国有极端的季节变化。</strong>北京冬天很冷（-10°C），而广州夏天很热（35°C+，湿度高）。关键是要分层打包，为您将要访问的特定城市和季节做好准备。全面而言：无论季节如何，舒适的步行鞋、移动电源、卫生纸和可重复使用的水瓶都是必需品。</p>
    </div>

        <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📋 在本指南中</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#year-round" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🎒 全年必备</a></li>
        <li><a href="#spring" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🌸 春季（三月至五月）</a></li>
        <li><a href="#summer" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">☀️ 夏季（6月至8月）</a></li>
        <li><a href="#autumn" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🍂 秋季（九月至十一月）</a></li>
        <li><a href="#winter" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">❄️ 冬季（12月至2月）</a></li>
        <li><a href="#city-guide" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🏙️ 城市快速指南</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="year-round" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🎒</span>全年必备</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8">无论何时何地，这些物品都应该放在你的包里：</p>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">项目</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">为什么</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>充电宝</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">手机电池在导航+翻译+支付时快速耗尽</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>通用旅行适配器</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">中国使用A/I型插座（220V）</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>便携式卫生纸/纸巾</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">许多公共厕所不提供纸张</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>洗手液</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">并非所有地方都有肥皂</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>可重复使用的水瓶</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">酒店和车站都有热水机</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>舒适的步行鞋</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">你平均每天走15000多步</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>一个小背包/背包</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">并非所有景点都允许携带大包</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>护照和签证复印件</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">也保留数字副本</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12 not-prose">
        <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>重要提示：</strong>对于国内航班和高铁安检，移动电源需要带有3C认证标志，容量不超过20000毫安时。如果您计划访问中国的多个城市，建议您在抵达的第一个城市购买合格的移动电源。</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="spring" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🌸</span>春季（三月至五月）</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>温度：</strong>10°C–25°C（北京较冷，广州较暖）</p>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8"><strong>条件：</strong>温和但不可预测。4月至5月可能会下雨，尤其是在南部。</p>

      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">包装：</p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 mb-12">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span>轻便夹克或连帽衫（必备——春夜可能很冷）</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span>长裤和长袖衬衫</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span>雨伞或轻便雨衣</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span>围巾（防风防尘）</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="summer" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">☀️</span>夏季（6月至8月）</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>Temperatures:</strong>25°C–40°C（北京干热，广州/上海潮湿）</p>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8"><strong>Conditions:</strong>到处都热。南方城市特别潮湿。季风降雨很常见。</p>

      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Pack:</p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 mb-12">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span>轻便透气的衣服（棉、亚麻）</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span>防晒霜（SPF 50+）</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span>太阳镜和帽子</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span>一把雨伞（既遮阳又防雨）</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-red-500">⚠️</span>许多景点（紫禁城、长城）的阴凉处很少——相应地规划</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="autumn" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🍂</span>秋季（九月至十一月）</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>Temperatures:</strong>5°C–22°C（冷却，舒适）</p>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8"><strong>Conditions:</strong>最愉快的季节。晴朗的天空，凉爽的空气，低湿度。</p>

      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Pack:</p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 mb-12">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span>层数：t恤+轻便夹克或毛衣</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span>牛仔裤或舒适的裤子</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span>晚上穿的中等重量夹克</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span>这是户外活动的理想季节</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="winter" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">❄️</span>冬季（12月至2月）</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>Temperatures:</strong>-15℃（北京/哈尔滨）至15℃（广州/深圳）</p>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8"><strong>Conditions:</strong>北方寒冷，南方温和。湿度低的干燥空气。</p>

      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">包（北方；南方像秋天）：</p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 mb-12">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span>冬季厚外套/羽绒服（北京、西安或北方任何地方必备）</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span>保暖内衣（如果去北方）</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span>帽子、手套、围巾——冬天不可商量</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span>润唇膏和保湿霜（中央供暖使皮肤干燥）</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-red-500">⚠️</span>哈尔滨可以达到-30°C——如果去那么远的北方，就带上极冷的装备</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="city-guide" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🏙️</span>城市快速指南</h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">城市</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">夏季（°C）</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">冬季（°C）</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">关键包装建议</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">北京</td><td class="px-6 py-4">25–35</td><td class="px-6 py-4">-10至5</td><td class="px-6 py-4">冬季厚外套，夏季防晒</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">上海</td><td class="px-6 py-4">25–37</td><td class="px-6 py-4">0–10</td><td class="px-6 py-4">全年潮湿；必备雨衣</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">广州</td><td class="px-6 py-4">28–38</td><td class="px-6 py-4">10–18</td><td class="px-6 py-4">全年温暖；轻便衣物+雨具</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">深圳</td><td class="px-6 py-4">28–35</td><td class="px-6 py-4">12–20</td><td class="px-6 py-4">与广州相似；夏季沙滩装</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">成都</td><td class="px-6 py-4">22–32</td><td class="px-6 py-4">2–10</td><td class="px-6 py-4">经常被高估；全年穿着舒适</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">西安</td><td class="px-6 py-4">23–35</td><td class="px-6 py-4">-5至8</td><td class="px-6 py-4">与北京相似，但稍微暖和一些</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📚 相关指南</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/life/survival-kit/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🎒 您的中国之旅生存工具包</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">完整的旅行前检查表</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/life/essential-apps/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">📱 中国需要的10个应用程序</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">导航等基本应用程序</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/transport/transport-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🚄 如何环游中国</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">轻松在城市之间导航</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  
    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">来源</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
        <li>实用的建议——没有单一的官方来源。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>